cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: >-
  If you use op_engine or its flepimop2 provider, please cite this software
  and record the exact shared release version used in your methods.
type: software
title: "op_engine: Operator-partitioned numerical solvers and flepimop2 provider"
abstract: >-
  Array-API numerical kernels for explicit, implicit, IMEX and stochastic
  integration of structured ODE/PDE models, with frozen-mesh replay and a
  separately distributed flepimop2 provider.
